                                "sense_id": "23f79115-9e29-3af1-a347-8d220f41a2eb",
                                "text": "Only after the explosion has particulated the poison and given it every opportunity to vaporize can any appreciable concentration of gas be present in the air."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "12b9eb1f-b8c2-46b9-9d95-044f24b4ccfb",
                                "sense_id": "23f79115-9e29-3af1-a347-8d220f41a2eb",
                                "text": "The study proved that Sialon particulated smaller than 0.5 micron could be sintered without using any auxiliary additives."
                            },
