                                "example_id": "52712db7-4f42-4cd6-98f3-06db939fa5c8",
                                "sense_id": "23f79115-9e29-3af1-a347-8d220f41a2eb",
                                "text": "The fascia is then particulated, rechecked for sterility, and loaded into syringes that are vacuum-packaged."
